WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:19.038
"Cool!" Jason said when he spotted Miss Shelly.

2
00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:21.216
She was wearing her chef's hat.

3
00:00:21.217 --> 00:00:25.977
That meant they were cooking today.

4
00:00:25.978 --> 00:00:30.931
He turned off his video game right away and put on his apron.

5
00:00:30.932 --> 00:00:33.916
"What are we making?" Nina asked.

6
00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:40.090
"A special meal," Miss Shelly said, "for very special dinner guests."

7
00:00:40.091 --> 00:00:43.219
"Dinner guests?" Jason said.

8
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.331
"What dinner guests?" Izzie asked.

9
00:00:46.332 --> 00:00:48.510
"Who are they?"

10
00:00:48.511 --> 00:00:53.529
"Let's get started so dinner will be ready when they get here," Miss Shelly said.

11
00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.238
She held up a menu.

12
00:00:55.239 --> 00:00:59.277
"Bobby, what are we having for dinner tonight?"

13
00:00:59.278 --> 00:01:03.646
"Spaghetti with tomato sauce," Bobby read.

14
00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:06.257
"First we need to make the sauce.

15
00:01:06.258 --> 00:01:09.913
Jason, what do we do?" Miss Shelly asked.

16
00:01:09.914 --> 00:01:12.720
Jason had already read the directions.

17
00:01:12.721 --> 00:01:15.667
He was reaching for a measuring cup.

18
00:01:15.668 --> 00:01:25.736
"We heat olive oil in a pot."

19
00:01:25.737 --> 00:01:31.472
"Next we add a head of garlic, chopped," Izzie read.

20
00:01:31.473 --> 00:01:34.413
"A head of garlic!"

21
00:01:34.414 --> 00:01:39.315
She imagined a giant head staring at her.

22
00:01:39.316 --> 00:01:44.598
"A 'head' means a whole garlic, like this." Jason held one up.

23
00:01:44.599 --> 00:01:52.017
"Jason's right." Miss Shelly handed Izzie some chopped garlic.

24
00:01:52.018 --> 00:01:56.023
"Cook the garlic in oil for three minutes," Nina read.

25
00:01:56.024 --> 00:02:01.463
"I'll set the timer!"

26
00:02:01.464 --> 00:02:04.356
"Now we add the tomatoes."

27
00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:11.001
Bobby emptied two cans of tomatoes into the pot.

28
00:02:11.002 --> 00:02:16.631
"Add red pepper flakes," Jason said, sprinkling in the pepper.

29
00:02:16.632 --> 00:02:19.116
"This makes the sauce spicy."

30
00:02:19.117 --> 00:02:23.920
"Since when do you know so much about cooking?" Izzie asked.

31
00:02:23.921 --> 00:02:29.854
"I like it. And I've been helping my mom and dad cook," he said.

32
00:02:29.855 --> 00:02:35.212
"Cook over low heat for one hour," Nina read. "One hour?"

33
00:02:35.213 --> 00:02:38.422
"Yep. It has to cook for a long time.

34
00:02:38.423 --> 00:02:41.858
And that's good," said Miss Shelly.

35
00:02:41.859 --> 00:02:45.434
"Because we have to get ready for our guests.

36
00:02:45.435 --> 00:02:50.415
We need to clean up, set the table, and cook the spaghetti.

37
00:02:50.416 --> 00:02:54.764
Who will clean up the scooters and balls?" Miss Shelly asked.

38
00:02:54.765 --> 00:02:59.460
"I will!" Bobby and Jason said at the same time.

39
00:02:59.461 --> 00:03:04.265
"Who will put out the tablecloth and dishes?" she asked.

40
00:03:04.266 --> 00:03:11.610
"We will!" Nina and Izzie said together.

41
00:03:11.611 --> 00:03:14.971
The kids cleaned and set the table for dinner.

42
00:03:14.972 --> 00:03:18.611
The gym looked like a real restaurant.

43
00:03:18.612 --> 00:03:22.655
Now it was time to cook the spaghetti.

44
00:03:22.656 --> 00:03:26.421
"Add a pinch of salt and boil the water," Jason read.

45
00:03:26.422 --> 00:03:31.458
"A pinch is like this, pinch!"

46
00:03:31.459 --> 00:03:34.858
"It's boiling!" Nina said.

47
00:03:34.859 --> 00:03:38.183
"Add the spaghetti.

48
00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:44.660
Cook for eleven minutes," Bobby read.

49
00:03:44.661 --> 00:03:47.905
"The table looks nice," Jason said.

50
00:03:47.906 --> 00:03:50.243
"But who are our guests?"

51
00:03:50.244 --> 00:03:55.808
Miss Shelly still wouldn't tell.

52
00:03:55.809 --> 00:04:04.920
"Time to drain the spaghetti," Miss Shelly said.

53
00:04:04.921 --> 00:04:19.043
"Now we mix the spaghetti and the sauce in a big bowl," she said, "and wait."

54
00:04:19.044 --> 00:04:21.211
There was a knock on the door.

55
00:04:21.212 --> 00:04:24.776
"Come in!" Miss Shelly called.

56
00:04:24.777 --> 00:04:27.691
It was everyone's parents!

57
00:04:27.692 --> 00:04:31.711
"Mom. Dad," Jason said, surprised.

58
00:04:31.712 --> 00:04:34.681
"You're our special guests!"

59
00:04:34.682 --> 00:04:40.446
"We heard you kids are excellent chefs," Jason's mom said.

60
00:04:40.447 --> 00:04:43.855
"This spaghetti smells delicious."

61
00:04:43.856 --> 00:04:48.048
"I bet it tastes delicious too," Miss Shelly said.

62
00:04:48.049 --> 00:04:52.179
"These kids have been working hard all afternoon."

63
00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:55.815
"But Miss Shelly always finds great recipes.

64
00:04:55.816 --> 00:04:59.522
And she shows us what to do," Jason added.

65
00:04:59.523 --> 00:05:05.565
"She makes cooking fun."

66
00:05:05.566 --> 00:05:22.243
[caption_out@
